{"season":2,"episode":1,"episode_title":"The Cold Shelf","scene":1,"character":"Rhea","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"The northern contract is worth more than everything you salvaged last year combined."}
{"season":2,"episode":1,"episode_title":"The Cold Shelf","scene":1,"character":"Vale","speaks_to":"Rhea","text":"And the water is four degrees and full of ice."}
{"season":2,"episode":1,"episode_title":"The Cold Shelf","scene":1,"character":"Rhea","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"So say no."}
{"season":2,"episode":1,"episode_title":"The Cold Shelf","scene":1,"character":"Vale","speaks_to":"Rhea","text":"I did not say no."}
{"season":2,"episode":1,"episode_title":"The Cold Shelf","scene":2,"character":"Marisol","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"Before I sign anything: nobody dives alone up there. Ever. Say it back to me."}
{"season":2,"episode":1,"episode_title":"The Cold Shelf","scene":2,"character":"Vale","speaks_to":"Marisol","text":"Nobody dives alone. I swear it."}
{"season":2,"episode":1,"episode_title":"The Cold Shelf","scene":3,"character":"Teddy","speaks_to":"Okonkwo","text":"He swore it. That means something, right?"}
{"season":2,"episode":1,"episode_title":"The Cold Shelf","scene":3,"character":"Okonkwo","speaks_to":"Teddy","text":"It means something to him when he says it. Watch what he does at four in the morning."}
{"season":2,"episode":1,"episode_title":"The Cold Shelf","scene":4,"character":"Marisol","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"Your tank is wet. You went down without me."}
{"season":2,"episode":1,"episode_title":"The Cold Shelf","scene":4,"character":"Vale","speaks_to":"Marisol","text":"It was a twenty minute look at the shelf."}
{"season":2,"episode":1,"episode_title":"The Cold Shelf","scene":4,"character":"Marisol","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"You swore. Eleven hours ago, in front of Rhea, you swore."}
{"season":2,"episode":1,"episode_title":"The Cold Shelf","scene":5,"character":"Okonkwo","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"If you do that again I walk. I do not threaten twice."}
{"season":2,"episode":1,"episode_title":"The Cold Shelf","scene":5,"character":"Vale","speaks_to":"Okonkwo","text":"Understood."}
{"season":2,"episode":1,"episode_title":"The Cold Shelf","scene":6,"character":"Bosun","speaks_to":"Rhea","text":"Six years I have worked this coast and I have never seen a crew stay with a man like that."}
{"season":2,"episode":1,"episode_title":"The Cold Shelf","scene":6,"character":"Rhea","speaks_to":"Bosun","text":"He gets them paid. Eventually."}
{"season":2,"episode":2,"episode_title":"Four Degrees","scene":1,"character":"Teddy","speaks_to":"Marisol","text":"My certification came through. Okonkwo's signature held up."}
{"season":2,"episode":2,"episode_title":"Four Degrees","scene":1,"character":"Marisol","speaks_to":"Teddy","text":"Good. Now never let him carry you again. Carry yourself."}
{"season":2,"episode":2,"episode_title":"Four Degrees","scene":2,"character":"Vale","speaks_to":"Teddy","text":"You are on the surface line today. You do not go in the water."}
{"season":2,"episode":2,"episode_title":"Four Degrees","scene":2,"character":"Teddy","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"I am certified now."}
{"season":2,"episode":2,"episode_title":"Four Degrees","scene":2,"character":"Vale","speaks_to":"Teddy","text":"You are certified in warm water. Surface line."}
{"season":2,"episode":2,"episode_title":"Four Degrees","scene":3,"character":"Rhea","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"You still owe me the season's share from the denied claim. You said before the season ended."}
{"season":2,"episode":2,"episode_title":"Four Degrees","scene":3,"character":"Vale","speaks_to":"Rhea","text":"The season is a flexible idea in this business."}
{"season":2,"episode":2,"episode_title":"Four Degrees","scene":3,"character":"Rhea","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"It is a calendar, Vale. It ended in March."}
{"season":2,"episode":2,"episode_title":"Four Degrees","scene":4,"character":"Okonkwo","speaks_to":"Marisol","text":"I told the boy I would take his rotation and I took it. It is not complicated."}
{"season":2,"episode":2,"episode_title":"Four Degrees","scene":4,"character":"Marisol","speaks_to":"Okonkwo","text":"For you it is not."}
{"season":2,"episode":2,"episode_title":"Four Degrees","scene":5,"character":"Marisol","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"The ice is moving. We surface in ten minutes, all of us, whatever we have found."}
{"season":2,"episode":2,"episode_title":"Four Degrees","scene":5,"character":"Vale","speaks_to":"Marisol","text":"Ten minutes. Agreed."}
{"season":2,"episode":2,"episode_title":"Four Degrees","scene":6,"character":"Marisol","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"That was twenty-six minutes."}
{"season":2,"episode":2,"episode_title":"Four Degrees","scene":6,"character":"Vale","speaks_to":"Marisol","text":"I found the strongbox."}
{"season":2,"episode":2,"episode_title":"Four Degrees","scene":6,"character":"Marisol","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"I did not ask what you found. I asked you to come up."}
{"season":2,"episode":2,"episode_title":"Four Degrees","scene":7,"character":"Okonkwo","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"I said I would walk."}
{"season":2,"episode":2,"episode_title":"Four Degrees","scene":7,"character":"Vale","speaks_to":"Okonkwo","text":"You said that about diving alone. This was different."}
{"season":2,"episode":2,"episode_title":"Four Degrees","scene":7,"character":"Okonkwo","speaks_to":"Vale","text":"It is never different. That is the whole trick of it."}
